WEBVTT

00:00:29.463 --> 00:00:32.763
-- All set, Kenneth?
-- Okay here, Doctor.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.301
All right, start the camera!

00:00:37.304 --> 00:00:40.239
In hooking a human subject up
to a PSI-scanner...

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.776
...we can clearly see all sorts
of images and shadows displayed.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.039
This is known as the
"mind shadow".

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:49.810
Within this shadow lies
a still unexplored universe.

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:54.548
What we call the "life force" blows
through this inner cosmos like a wind.

00:00:54.655 --> 00:00:57.454
I have chosen to
call this wind "Vajura".

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.720
This device, the "Mandala",
will amplify the mind shadow...

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:04.297
...increasing the Vajura
component to infinity.

00:01:05.032 --> 00:01:07.228
It's finished, Kenneth!

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.228
Our Mandala!

00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:16.908
How do you feel, Tanya?

00:01:17.611 --> 00:01:22.447
It's incredibly exhilarating...
But without being tiring.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.744
As the Vajura level increases,
it will give birth to...

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.583
...a hitherto hidden power of
unbelievable proportions.

00:01:28.689 --> 00:01:33.855
From that inner cosmos of creation
and annihilation will come the child.

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:36.658
My child...Genocyber!

00:02:25.112 --> 00:02:28.013
The nine day meeting of the
Council of Advanced Nations...

00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:31.016
...ended on a genial note,
with the delegates issuing a...

00:02:31.118 --> 00:02:35.248
...joint declaration announcing the
resolution of the Mid-East question.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:40.726
The Council president also declared
the final elimination of...

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:45.264
...individual national armies with the
strong probability of Japan, China...

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:49.268
...and Israel agreeing to join
their remaining military might...

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:51.269
...with the new
United Nations Troops.

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:09.282
What's it take to get through
to you, ya little piece of shit?!

00:03:11.158 --> 00:03:13.456
Come on,
he just isn't that good yet.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.551
Zip it!
How'd he screw up this bad?!

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:18.421
After we work so hard to
get rid of that counterfeit money...

00:03:18.532 --> 00:03:21.229
...you go and let someone
pay you back with it!

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:24.637
Man, is he pissed!

00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:27.940
Won't be letting him
off easy THIS time!

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.580
Never should of taken you on
in the first place.

00:03:35.282 --> 00:03:37.910
Now get lost!
You'd be doin' us a favor.

00:03:40.821 --> 00:03:42.755
Come on, let's find us
a little tail.

00:03:43.557 --> 00:03:45.150
Sounds good to me!

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:06.195
The Council president is
proposing basing the UNT in orbit...

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:11.403
...in order to facilitate the
delegates' declaration, isn't he?

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:12.438
That's correct.

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:14.579
So, if this plan becomes reality...

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:18.811
...we've seen the last of individual
national armies, haven't we?

00:05:18.919 --> 00:05:22.981
Well, this still doesn't include
all "military forces" in the world.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:25.925
For example, there's still
the case of the weaponry...

00:05:26.026 --> 00:05:28.825
...held by many of
the world's corporations.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.432
He was an assistant instructor at
the Kyuryu Science Institute, right?

00:05:39.539 --> 00:05:41.439
Has a motive been determined yet?

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:44.511
Could this be backlash against
Japanese corporations moving in?

00:05:44.611 --> 00:05:45.772
<i>No comment'.!</i>

00:05:48.615 --> 00:05:52.574
I may get some clues from an old
friend at the Kyuryu Institute.

00:05:53.887 --> 00:05:55.912
For example, take the Kyuryu Group,
a Japanese corporation.

00:05:56.623 --> 00:06:00.787
They're a world-spanning conglomerate
specializing in weapons development.

00:06:00.894 --> 00:06:05.058
I suppose you can
call it a type of army.

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:07.664
Kyuryu Science Institute.

00:06:11.137 --> 00:06:13.037
Thank you for
being here tonight.

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:16.006
It appears we have
a long way to go...

00:06:16.109 --> 00:06:19.545
...before the world can be
completely free of weapons.

00:06:24.251 --> 00:06:28.711
Heaven... Gods...
War... Nation...

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:31.786
Yes... Most impressive.

00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:35.292
Have him moved to
a third-level class tomorrow.

00:06:35.695 --> 00:06:37.220
Yes, sir.

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:42.524
Yes?

00:06:42.836 --> 00:06:45.305
Some police officers
wish to see you, sir.

00:06:45.872 --> 00:06:48.239
One of them says
to tell you "It's Davey".

00:06:49.276 --> 00:06:53.042
I see. Bring them to
my room in ten minutes.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:37.788
They say there's never any point
looking back at the past in this city.

00:07:38.591 --> 00:07:41.219
And it was 13 years ago...

00:07:41.995 --> 00:07:45.989
14 years, since that "incident"
at the Morgan Institute.

00:07:46.099 --> 00:07:48.796
Incident?
"Accident" is what you mean.

00:07:48.902 --> 00:07:52.896
I was a lot younger then, and not
nearly as careful in my research.

00:07:53.073 --> 00:07:55.735
It's a shame we lost Dr. Morgan...

00:07:56.109 --> 00:07:57.235
Kenneth Reed!

00:07:57.544 --> 00:08:02.106
I swear, if you've resumed Morgan's
insane research, I'll shut you down!

00:08:03.016 --> 00:08:05.110
I've no idea what
you're talking about.

00:08:05.218 --> 00:08:08.449
I assumed Ho Lown's death
was fairly cut and dry.

00:08:08.555 --> 00:08:10.956
He was involved with the
city's underworld, wasn't he?

00:08:11.891 --> 00:08:13.655
Just have to keep
jerking me around, huh...'?

00:08:14.561 --> 00:08:17.690
Consider this a courtesy call.
I'll come back here, soon.

00:08:19.132 --> 00:08:21.260
And when I do,
that'll be it for you!

00:08:21.668 --> 00:08:22.635
Get out!

00:08:31.711 --> 00:08:33.543
Stop it, Diana!

00:08:45.592 --> 00:08:46.889
Get out.

00:08:49.095 --> 00:08:51.792
And don't come back, ever!

00:09:09.115 --> 00:09:10.048
Father...

00:09:11.918 --> 00:09:15.616
So, Elaine removed her
Vajura restraint necklace.

00:09:16.356 --> 00:09:17.755
Yes.

00:09:18.124 --> 00:09:22.357
I can't complete
my research without her.

00:09:22.462 --> 00:09:25.659
You, more than anyone,
must realize that.

00:09:25.765 --> 00:09:26.732
I do...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.362
We have to find her
as soon as possible.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.167
And for that, I need you!

00:09:35.208 --> 00:09:37.006
But Father...!

00:09:37.944 --> 00:09:41.847
We can't allow anyone outside this
institute to see the power of Vajura.

00:09:44.117 --> 00:09:45.516
Yes, Father...

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:53.192
Are you turning against me now,
after I saved your life'?!

00:09:55.228 --> 00:09:59.825
N-- No!
I'm grateful for everything!

00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:05.372
Without me, you wouldn't be alive.
Never forget that.

00:10:14.481 --> 00:10:18.384
Elaine Reed.
She's our next target.

00:10:18.485 --> 00:10:24.151
The file they sent over says
her power's pretty dangerous stuff.

00:10:24.257 --> 00:10:27.887
Like we've never had to
take down an esper before?

00:10:28.761 --> 00:10:30.889
Yeah, yeah.
This'll be a milk run.

00:10:31.431 --> 00:10:34.890
Anyway, once we find her,
we take her back to Tokyo.

00:10:35.502 --> 00:10:39.405
She can be minus an arm or a leg,
just as long as she's alive.

00:12:14.734 --> 00:12:17.567
Elaine's currently
in a peaceful mindset.

00:12:19.072 --> 00:12:21.871
She hasn't been this stable
since she escaped.

00:12:23.142 --> 00:12:25.975
Good.
This is our best chance, then.

00:12:26.746 --> 00:12:34.210
Father... Do I exist just to
control Elaine when she goes wild?

00:12:35.421 --> 00:12:41.383
That machine was built because only
you can control Elaine's Vajura.

00:12:44.264 --> 00:12:48.064
She doesn't understand
how to control her power!

00:12:48.167 --> 00:12:51.569
She's dangerous!
To you, and to me--

00:12:55.875 --> 00:13:00.312
Diana!
Start dealing with this!

00:13:00.813 --> 00:13:04.511
I need both of you alive.
Both of you!

00:13:22.268 --> 00:13:23.633
Okay, we're ready.

00:13:32.045 --> 00:13:34.844
What the hell's this?
It's terrible...

00:13:39.052 --> 00:13:40.383
There! Freeze it!

00:13:41.054 --> 00:13:42.544
I'll try to ID her,
and anything else I can.

00:13:43.389 --> 00:13:46.916
So who's this girl?
Looks like she was following Ho.

00:13:48.061 --> 00:13:51.520
She almost looks like...
Can that be it?

00:13:53.066 --> 00:13:55.000
That was pretty sharp
detective work...

00:13:55.101 --> 00:13:58.867
...your spotting her in an outtake
from a TV series they were shooting.

00:13:58.971 --> 00:14:03.238
She may be the key to this whole case.
We have to alert the entire city.

00:14:03.343 --> 00:14:05.539
Right, I'll get on it...

00:14:14.754 --> 00:14:16.984
And now it's time for
"Hong Kong Tonight."

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:22.051
We'll start off tonight with
news of a kidnapping case.

00:14:23.696 --> 00:14:28.065
One...two...three...four,
and this makes five.

00:14:29.202 --> 00:14:32.001
There's your cut.

00:14:32.105 --> 00:14:33.630
Thanks.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.669
Keep up the sales
and you get more.

00:14:35.775 --> 00:14:38.005
Always a pleasure, boss.

00:14:38.111 --> 00:14:41.012
By the way,
where's that other kid?

00:14:41.114 --> 00:14:44.084
He wasn't worth the trouble,
so I got rid of him.

00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:47.547
He's probably somewhere pissing in
his pants and crying his eyes out.

00:14:48.121 --> 00:14:50.715
Crying? I doubt it.

00:14:50.823 --> 00:14:55.283
I saw him yesterday in the city,
going around with an older girl.

00:14:55.395 --> 00:14:56.021
No shit?

00:14:56.462 --> 00:15:01.127
Yeah. Maybe you guys can get some
pointers from him on picking up women!

00:15:07.073 --> 00:15:09.041
Not bad at all...

00:15:09.142 --> 00:15:11.611
You hogging the fun
all to your lonesome?

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:18.809
So, why don't you dump the little shit
and have some real fun with us?

00:15:19.652 --> 00:15:21.552
What's your name?

00:15:26.426 --> 00:15:28.258
C'mon, what's your name?

00:15:28.361 --> 00:15:31.092
-- Say something!
-- You're wasting your time.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:38.901
Oh well, we can have some fun and then
take her to the boss for more money.

00:15:41.707 --> 00:15:43.072
Come on, you!

00:15:44.677 --> 00:15:46.509
I want you to get
a good look at this.

00:15:47.947 --> 00:15:50.006
Should you do it
in front of a little kid?

00:15:50.116 --> 00:15:52.847
Let's see how little
he really is.

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.716
So, feel good? Huh?

00:15:55.455 --> 00:15:57.423
What are you wearing?

00:16:04.397 --> 00:16:06.365
Now, just be nice and quiet...

00:16:16.075 --> 00:16:17.600
Wha-- What the hell?!

00:16:29.689 --> 00:16:31.123
Come home, Elaine!

00:16:38.264 --> 00:16:39.629
Restrain your Vajura!

00:16:40.633 --> 00:16:45.628
One...two...three...four...

00:16:46.439 --> 00:16:47.406
FIVE!

00:16:57.116 --> 00:16:58.515
She escaped?

00:16:58.618 --> 00:17:01.952
She dodged my shock wave and
broke through the barrier I set up.

00:17:02.054 --> 00:17:07.515
-- Can you locate her?
-- Yes, but she isn't alone!

00:17:07.627 --> 00:17:08.719
What?!

00:17:09.061 --> 00:17:11.689
She took a street kid with her!

00:17:34.353 --> 00:17:36.720
So, someone's spotted
the kidnapped girl?

00:17:36.989 --> 00:17:39.822
Confirmed by a bunch of eyewitnesses.

00:17:39.926 --> 00:17:42.088
Get some cops to board at the
next station and keep an eye on her.

00:17:42.562 --> 00:17:44.394
Until this is over,
don't lose that train!

00:18:31.744 --> 00:18:33.644
Shall we go?

00:18:33.746 --> 00:18:36.374
What do we want with the kid?

00:18:36.482 --> 00:18:40.316
Romeo's our insurance, in case Juliet
decides to be uncooperative.

00:18:40.419 --> 00:18:41.716
' Get you.

00:18:43.923 --> 00:18:44.890
What's wrong?!

00:18:49.662 --> 00:18:52.393
Oh God... Get 'em out!

00:18:53.532 --> 00:18:56.433
The bugs--
They're crawlin' into my head!

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:59.395
Calm down! What bugs'?

00:19:02.208 --> 00:19:04.734
Get a hold of yourself!
Where do you see bugs?

00:19:05.611 --> 00:19:08.012
They're eatin' my brains out!

00:19:33.339 --> 00:19:34.500
God dammit...

00:19:38.978 --> 00:19:42.710
Father, why didn't you
let me go after her?

00:19:43.916 --> 00:19:48.547
Elaine's Vajura power is
far greater than we expected.

00:19:50.089 --> 00:19:53.059
We have to be careful,
or else you'll be in danger.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.061
So, what do I do now?

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:03.733
Impose your Vajura onto her mind,
and try to take control of her.

00:20:05.538 --> 00:20:06.835
What's wrong?!

00:20:06.939 --> 00:20:07.997
No...

00:20:08.107 --> 00:20:09.404
Diana!

00:20:09.508 --> 00:20:16.574
I'll do it...for you.
But why? Why her...?!

00:20:18.684 --> 00:20:25.522
Do as I say! You and Elaine
were born to a common destiny.

00:20:27.126 --> 00:20:30.926
I can't afford to
lose either of you!

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:34.261
Now that I'm on the verge
of completing the project...

00:20:34.366 --> 00:20:36.733
...you have to lose sight
of your purpose?

00:20:45.978 --> 00:20:48.447
I'll do it, Father...

00:20:53.686 --> 00:20:56.178
There's something
weird about that girl.

00:20:56.522 --> 00:20:58.923
Weird? How?

00:20:59.024 --> 00:21:02.085
Can't put my finger on it,
but she's special, somehow.

00:21:02.628 --> 00:21:03.857
In what way?

00:21:03.963 --> 00:21:06.591
I dunno. Maybe you should
ask that other detective.

00:21:06.799 --> 00:21:09.769
He hasn't left her side
since she came here.

00:21:12.471 --> 00:21:14.200
14 years ago...

00:21:14.306 --> 00:21:15.899
That was when I first heard of...

00:21:16.008 --> 00:21:19.444
...Dr. Nguyen Morgan's development
of a new strategic super-weapon.

00:21:20.479 --> 00:21:27.112
If completed, it could've upset
the balance of power in the world.

00:21:28.087 --> 00:21:32.320
But then the Morgan Institute was
destroyed by an unexplained explosion.

00:21:32.424 --> 00:21:35.359
The professor and
his wife were killed.

00:21:35.461 --> 00:21:39.523
The weapon, and all data on it,
were lost forever.

00:21:40.099 --> 00:21:43.467
And then, five years later,
his partner, Kenneth Reed...

00:21:43.569 --> 00:21:47.028
...became director of the
Kyuryu Science Institute.

00:21:47.907 --> 00:21:50.808
<i>The head of the Kyuryu Group,
Benito Kyuryu, gave mm...</i>

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.470
...complete backing to set up an
independent research institute.

00:21:53.913 --> 00:21:55.813
Hell of a career break,
wouldn't you say?

00:21:56.782 --> 00:21:59.308
What's this...? His daughter?

00:21:59.852 --> 00:22:03.811
Yeah.
Now look at the next one.

00:22:04.456 --> 00:22:06.948
The face is a
little hard to make out...

00:22:07.059 --> 00:22:08.584
Tanya Morgan?!

00:22:08.694 --> 00:22:11.493
Yeah.
And obviously very pregnant, too.

00:22:12.298 --> 00:22:13.766
Then you're saying--

00:22:13.866 --> 00:22:16.426
She didn't die in the explosion...

00:22:16.535 --> 00:22:19.505
...but after it, giving birth
to a little girl.

00:22:20.072 --> 00:22:21.699
So this child is...

00:22:22.474 --> 00:22:25.102
The lost posterity
of Dr. Nguyen Morgan.

00:22:25.311 --> 00:22:29.441
One month later, my informant
unexpectedly died of a heart attack.

00:22:30.049 --> 00:22:33.610
All the files he had kept
on his investigation were stolen.

00:22:34.486 --> 00:22:38.116
This girl is Morgan's daughter,
kept hidden all these years.

00:22:38.224 --> 00:22:41.717
And somehow, she's the sister
of that girl at Reed's place!

00:22:44.263 --> 00:22:48.131
She'll be what I need to
take down both Kyuru and Reed!

00:24:06.278 --> 00:24:08.610
So I've finally
caught up with you, Elaine.

00:24:09.682 --> 00:24:11.912
Come home with me.

00:24:12.117 --> 00:24:16.918
We belong in that building...
Don't you see that?

00:24:18.624 --> 00:24:20.683
Father is so worried about you.

00:24:20.793 --> 00:24:23.490
He's not my father.

00:24:23.796 --> 00:24:24.888
What are you saying?

00:24:24.997 --> 00:24:27.932
I can't let you into me.

00:24:28.133 --> 00:24:30.761
Always the disobedient child,
aren't you?

00:24:30.869 --> 00:24:34.430
Your body may grow, but you
still have an infant's mind.

00:24:35.574 --> 00:24:38.509
Diana... You'd die.

00:24:39.812 --> 00:24:42.110
<i>I'd die...?!</i>

00:24:42.214 --> 00:24:44.876
I'm not going back.

00:24:45.317 --> 00:24:46.614
<i>0h my God“).!</i>

00:24:50.489 --> 00:24:52.787
Very well, then.
I won't ask you anymore.

00:24:53.826 --> 00:24:56.056
You little monster...

00:24:56.161 --> 00:24:59.791
I hate you.
I hate everything about you!

00:25:04.937 --> 00:25:06.371
Diana, no! Stop it!

00:25:09.441 --> 00:25:13.776
You won't cause me any more grief
after I kill you!

00:25:39.071 --> 00:25:40.539
It's begun.

00:26:21.280 --> 00:26:26.741
So, shall I rip you apart?
So you can be just like me?!

00:26:55.481 --> 00:26:58.451
All right... Elaine, stop it!
PLEASE!

00:27:00.319 --> 00:27:02.720
I DON'T WANT TO DIE!

00:27:21.540 --> 00:27:23.668
Elaine Reed!
Stay where you are!

00:27:24.143 --> 00:27:27.044
Now come along quietly with us.

00:27:27.713 --> 00:27:33.777
That is, unless you want your
raggedy little bodyguard to die.

00:29:19.524 --> 00:29:21.549
Get Diana back at once!

00:29:21.660 --> 00:29:24.425
We have to get her into the
Mandala before it's too late!

00:29:25.264 --> 00:29:26.322
Who the devil-J?!

00:29:31.036 --> 00:29:33.767
Don't fight us, Reed.

00:29:33.872 --> 00:29:38.207
Or shall we turn
everyone here into corned beef?

00:29:43.015 --> 00:29:46.679
I see... You were sent from
the corporate headquarters.

00:29:47.052 --> 00:29:49.851
Properly speaking,
we're company agents.

00:29:49.955 --> 00:29:52.720
You've made some...arbitrary decisions.

00:29:52.824 --> 00:29:55.794
The CEO of the Kyuryu Group is
very interested in your research...

00:29:55.894 --> 00:29:57.020
...and so a decision was made.

00:29:57.829 --> 00:30:02.630
We were ordered here to take
Elaine Reed back with us.

00:30:03.568 --> 00:30:08.028
But she's dead. Because Diana,
the only one who could...

00:30:08.140 --> 00:30:12.634
...control Elaine's Vajura,
couldn't exist with her.

00:30:17.082 --> 00:30:22.350
Talk, Reed! We couldn't find
Elaine's body anywhere.

00:30:23.588 --> 00:30:26.353
What did Diana do with her?!

00:30:26.458 --> 00:30:29.826
Diana, in her madness,
tried to kill Elaine.

00:30:29.928 --> 00:30:34.889
But Elaine lost control of her
Vajura beyond any predictions.

00:30:35.000 --> 00:30:40.837
When that power was released,
it may have transformed her.

00:30:40.939 --> 00:30:44.239
Vajura has influenced
everything in their lives.

00:30:44.343 --> 00:30:47.745
They were strongly affected
by it since their birth.

00:30:48.613 --> 00:30:51.844
It's the reason Diana was born
with non-functioning limbs...

00:30:51.950 --> 00:30:55.750
...and Elaine has
the mind of a wild animal.

00:30:57.122 --> 00:31:02.788
I later discovered that Elaine
possessed a multiple mind shadow...

00:31:02.894 --> 00:31:06.023
...although it was
Diana who first sensed it.

00:31:06.131 --> 00:31:10.034
She apparently was unconsciously
able to enter Elaine's mind.

00:31:18.744 --> 00:31:21.805
That's enough... Stop it, Reed!

00:31:21.913 --> 00:31:25.349
That's when Diana began
to control Elaine.

00:31:25.450 --> 00:31:29.478
And Elaine began to comprehend
what it meant "to live".

00:31:29.588 --> 00:31:34.526
I constructed a new Mandala,
to fuse their powers together.

00:31:34.626 --> 00:31:38.392
The fusion of light elements,
as in nuclear fusion...

00:31:38.497 --> 00:31:41.330
...will release incredible
amounts of energy.

00:31:41.433 --> 00:31:48.237
Similarly, Elaine's mind shadow
amplified Diana's powers.

00:31:48.340 --> 00:31:51.275
That's when I knew
for certain it would work!

00:31:51.376 --> 00:31:54.311
If I were to somehow
combine the two of them...

00:31:54.413 --> 00:31:57.405
...they'd produce an
incredibly powerful Vajura level--

00:31:59.785 --> 00:32:02.345
You're talking out of
your asshole, old man!

00:32:03.054 --> 00:32:06.046
The guy's a megalomaniac
with a Frankenstein complex.

00:32:09.661 --> 00:32:11.459
So now what?

00:32:11.563 --> 00:32:14.225
We take him and Diana
back to Tokyo.

00:32:14.332 --> 00:32:18.030
We'll need them to explain
what happened to Elaine.

00:32:22.707 --> 00:32:23.731
Diana!

00:32:27.479 --> 00:32:32.508
Why? Why did you kill her?
Why did you have to interfere?!

00:32:33.718 --> 00:32:36.415
Why did I suffer
all those hardships?

00:32:37.222 --> 00:32:41.125
What was the point if you
can't live without my help?

00:32:41.226 --> 00:32:44.196
Tell me! Tell me, Diana!

00:33:00.579 --> 00:33:04.072
Di...a...na...

00:33:04.182 --> 00:33:06.981
Who's here...?
Who's in here with rne?

00:33:12.691 --> 00:33:14.819
There, do you hear it?

00:33:18.797 --> 00:33:20.561
A <i>bOY-</i>

00:33:20.665 --> 00:33:22.497
No, it'll be a girl.

00:33:22.868 --> 00:33:24.063
Who is he?

00:33:26.872 --> 00:33:28.670
What is this?

00:33:29.207 --> 00:33:33.667
It feels so familiar,
so warm...

00:33:38.783 --> 00:33:40.512
Kenneth,
what's the meaning of this?!

00:33:41.486 --> 00:33:42.453
Father...

00:33:43.822 --> 00:33:47.656
We need more extensive facilities
for our Vajura research.

00:33:47.759 --> 00:33:51.662
Kenneth, you bastard!
You've gone over to Kyuryu--?!

00:33:56.234 --> 00:33:59.363
Who are you'?!
You're still inside of me.

00:34:02.841 --> 00:34:04.809
What's going on?

00:34:05.443 --> 00:34:06.968
Are you saying...?!

00:34:16.688 --> 00:34:21.626
It's you, isn't it?
Elaine...

00:34:22.527 --> 00:34:25.497
I'm seeing everything
that you saw.

00:34:27.098 --> 00:34:31.160
You knew who
our real father was.

00:34:34.372 --> 00:34:41.108
But, I didn't know!
I couldn't know!

00:34:41.813 --> 00:34:45.807
L__ I,..

00:34:46.117 --> 00:34:49.519
I was born
as a part of you!

00:34:53.792 --> 00:34:56.193
How can you say that when
you know it's the truth?!

00:34:56.728 --> 00:34:58.924
Kenneth Reed
is my real father!

00:35:00.065 --> 00:35:03.330
He gave me this body
because he loves me!

00:35:04.069 --> 00:35:08.802
Your body's dead!
Stay out of mine!

00:35:09.774 --> 00:35:11.139
What the...

00:35:12.177 --> 00:35:13.645
That boy?

00:35:40.872 --> 00:35:42.863
Stop it!
Stop it, Elaine!

00:35:43.541 --> 00:35:48.103
I know what you're trying to do.
But I don't want you to!

00:35:48.213 --> 00:35:51.274
You're dead!
Can't you see it's over?

00:35:51.883 --> 00:35:55.615
Stay away from me!
Get out of <i>my</i> mind!

00:35:55.720 --> 00:36:00.487
This is my body!
I WANT To LIVE!!!

00:36:07.065 --> 00:36:10.467
Di...a...na...a

00:36:50.542 --> 00:36:54.410
ATC, we've just spotted
an explosion of the ground.

00:36:54.512 --> 00:36:55.775
Can we still land?

00:36:55.880 --> 00:36:57.177
I don't know.

00:36:57.282 --> 00:36:59.944
Until I can get confirmation,
you'd better hold up there.

00:37:00.051 --> 00:37:02.213
Roger. Circling Hong Kong.

00:37:06.357 --> 00:37:08.257
Are you kidding?!

00:37:09.561 --> 00:37:10.619
What the...?

00:37:10.729 --> 00:37:14.290
We can't get near the fires
to put them out!

00:37:14.399 --> 00:37:17.061
Why?
How the hell should I know?!

00:37:17.168 --> 00:37:19.159
Just start evacuating
everyone out of here!

00:37:48.032 --> 00:37:49.397
Can't...move...

00:37:50.201 --> 00:37:53.967
All my systems are locked...
But why?

00:38:20.331 --> 00:38:21.492
What was...?!

00:38:35.847 --> 00:38:41.513
Control, can we land or not?
I'm running out of fuel up here!

00:38:41.619 --> 00:38:44.645
Stay up there!
Don't try to land!

00:39:00.772 --> 00:39:03.104
It's beautiful.

00:39:03.474 --> 00:39:05.533
What is that thing?

00:39:05.643 --> 00:39:10.843
Why are you asking me'?
I just know one thing...

00:39:14.719 --> 00:39:16.187
I want it DEAD!

00:39:16.487 --> 00:39:17.613
So do I.

00:39:21.659 --> 00:39:23.525
Oh God,
it's so beautiful!

00:40:56.821 --> 00:40:58.220
Here I am.

00:41:10.668 --> 00:41:13.797
We won't be able to
play together anymore.

00:41:15.340 --> 00:41:16.705
I really liked it.

00:41:20.178 --> 00:41:23.478
I've never had
that much fun in my life.

00:41:25.083 --> 00:41:27.643
But, I have to go now.

00:41:33.524 --> 00:41:38.360
I'll always love you.
Good-bye.

00:41:42.533 --> 00:41:44.126
Good-bye...

00:41:46.938 --> 00:41:47.871
Guh--

00:41:47.972 --> 00:41:49.098
Good--

00:41:49.207 --> 00:41:50.732
Buh--

00:41:50.842 --> 00:41:52.810
BYE!!!

00:42:59.877 --> 00:43:03.438
Elaine... Elaine...

00:43:11.489 --> 00:43:13.651
Diana...

00:43:13.758 --> 00:43:17.456
We live.

00:43:41.686 --> 00:43:47.591
I want you, and love you
Fairy Dreamin'.

00:43:47.692 --> 00:43:52.254
I lie in bed tonight,
counting the stars above.

00:43:53.798 --> 00:43:58.258
And once again,
I call out to you.

00:43:59.470 --> 00:44:05.204
The bustling town,
sparkling outside.

00:44:05.309 --> 00:44:13.309
Shining like a dreamy rainbow,
little my dear Fairy.

00:44:15.186 --> 00:44:20.488
It was a little lie,
an important one.

00:44:20.591 --> 00:44:23.219
One that I couldn't say.

00:44:23.761 --> 00:44:30.497
The dream I had, on this night,
about you, my darling...

00:44:30.601 --> 00:44:38.601
Now I know, I'll never have
that dream again.

00:44:39.844 --> 00:44:47.844
I don't have the strength
to stop the hands of time.

00:44:48.953 --> 00:44:56.953
So don't forget my darling
I love you, Fairy Dreamin'.

00:45:25.756 --> 00:45:33.756
Oh let it come again,
my fading dream.

00:45:37.935 --> 00:45:45.501
It drifts away,
a sweet night's memory.

00:45:45.610 --> 00:45:49.342
But just for now,
I know I love you so.

00:45:49.447 --> 00:45:55.352
Since that day,
that you held me close.

00:45:55.453 --> 00:46:02.291
I can finally tell you now,
that tiny, important lie.
